The daemon compiles Core's agent codecs. Linux Common currently provides
the DRM ABI; its local-agent ABI is not implemented.

INSTALLED RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES, NOT REDISTRIBUTED

The daemon dynamically links the guest's C library and invokes the
installed systemctl program for power commands. The compatibility helper
also invokes installed loginctl and coreutils timeout programs. Their
interfaces and licence records are listed in DEPENDENCIES.md.

The session bridge uses the installed GNOME Shell, Mutter, GJS, GLib,
GObject and GIO interfaces. Their licence identifiers are recorded in
session-bridge/DEPENDENCIES.md. No runtime copies are bundled here.

